    },
    {
      "text": "Rule one. You must have led England out in a tournament semi-final.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "RULE 1",
        "body": "Must have captained England in a World Cup or Euros semi-final."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Wright, Robson, Shearer, Beckham, Gerrard, Terry and Rooney never did. Seven gone.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "NO SEMI",
        "color": "yellow"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Three left. Moore, Adams at Euro ninety-six, and Kane, who has done it four times.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "timeline",
        "items": [
          {
            "year": "1966",
            "label": "Moore"
          },
          {
            "year": "1996",
            "label": "Adams"
          },
          {
            "year": "2018",
            "label": "Kane"
          },
          {
            "year": "2021",
            "label": "Kane"
          },
          {
            "year": "2024",
            "label": "Kane"
          },
          {
            "year": "2026",
            "label": "Kane"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule two. You must have captained England in a major final.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "RULE 2",
        "body": "Must have captained England in a World Cup or Euros final."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Adams lost that semi on penalties to Germany. He's out.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "OUT",
        "person": "adams",
        "color": "red"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Moore in nineteen sixty-six. Kane in two Euros finals.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "Finals as captain",
        "left": {
          "person": "moore",
          "label": "Moore",
          "value": "1"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "kane_eng",
          "label": "Kane",
          "value": "2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule three. You must have won the Ballon d'Or.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "RULE 3",
        "body": "Must have won the Ballon d'Or."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Moore came so close. Second in nineteen seventy, behind Gerd Müller.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "podium",
        "year": "1970",
        "title": "Ballon d'Or 1970",
        "places": [
          {
            "name": "Gerd Müller",
            "club": "ger"
          },
          {
            "person": "moore"
          },
          {
            "name": "Luigi Riva",
            "club": "ita"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kane won it last month. So the rules hand the armband to Harry Kane.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "kane_eng",
        "label": "THE LAST NAME LEFT",
        "mood": "happy",
        "stamp": "WINNER"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But Moore lifted the World Cup. Who's your greatest captain?",
